I invest more in the global gaming industry and in related and adjacent sectors, with the CEO and leadership team unchanged.","value_creation_source_url":"https://www.cvc.com/media/news/2026/gaming-laboratories-international-gli-welcomes-cvc-strategic-opportunities-as-its-first-external-investor/","notes":"Investment completed into GLI and related entities through CVC's long-duration Strategic Opportunities platform; size of stake and terms not disclosed, so deal type left blank. Matt Turner (Partner, CVC) joined the GLI board."}},{"name":"Reflection AI","website":"https://reflection.ai/","description":"Reflection builds open models that let anyone control their intelligence, releasing open weights, research and software with the mission to build the future of open intelligence.","sector":"Technology","subsector":"Frontier AI / open-weight foundation models","country":"United States","leaders":[{"role":"ceo","name":"Misha Laskin","title":"Co-Founder & CEO","source_url":"https://lsvp.com/stories/towards-superintelligence-reflection-ai/","source_kind":"sponsor","evidence":"Misha Laskin (Co-Founder & CEO) and Ioannis Antonoglou (Co-Founder & CTO) are not only accomplished AI researchers"},{"role":"other","name":"Ioannis Antonoglou","title":"Co-Founder & CTO","source_url":"https://lsvp.com/stories/towards-superintelligence-reflection-ai/","source_kind":"sponsor","evidence":"Ioannis Antonoglou (Co-Founder & CTO)"}],"notes":"Hiring across New York, San Francisco, London and Washington D.C. (careers page). Named collaborations include the U.S. Department of Energy (Genesis Mission) and Shinsegae (sovereign South Korean cloud). Its news page links CNBC (2026-04-23) 'Reflection CEO confirms latest funding round closed at $25 billion pre-money valuation'; the article itself could not be opened, so no round size is recorded. No employee count, revenue or EBITDA published.","sources":{"description":{"url":"https://reflection.ai/","name":"Reflection AI","kind":"company","as_of":null,"evidence":"Make intelligence open and accessible to all. We build open models that let anyone control their intelligence and help shape the future of AI."},"country":{"url":"https://www.adventinternational.com/investments/","name":"Advent International","kind":"sponsor","as_of":null,"evidence":"Reflection AI | July 2026 | An AI company | Topics | United States | Reflection AI | Expansion capital | Technology"},"sector":{"url":"https://www.adventinternational.com/investments/","name":"Advent International","kind":"sponsor","as_of":null,"evidence":"Reflection AI | July 2026 | An AI company | ... | Expansion capital | Technology"}},"holding":{"sponsor":"Advent International","status":"current","status_note":"Expansion-capital investment, July 2026","asset_class":"Growth equity","deal_type":"Growth investment","notes":"Advent's investments page lists Reflection AI as 'July 2026 | An AI company | United States | Expansion capital | Technology'. No Advent press release found, so size, stake and value-creation plan are not recorded."}},{"name":"CreditorWatch","website":"https://creditorwatch.com.au/","description":"CreditorWatch is Australia's only dedicated B2B credit reporting agency, offering credit reporting and risk management solutions from onboarding and automated credit decisioning to monitoring, KYC/AML reporting and automated collections.","sector":"Financial services / data and information services","subsector":"Commercial credit reporting and risk analytics","country":"Australia","founded_year":2010,"business_model":"B2B (credit reporting and risk analytics platform)","email":"companysecretary@creditorwatch.com.au","email_type":"investor_relations","employees":230,"employees_text":"a team of 230+ people","employees_as_of":"2026-07-09","leaders":[{"role":"ceo","name":"Patrick Coghlan","title":"Chief Executive Officer","source_url":"https://creditorwatch.com.au/company/about-us","source_kind":"company","evidence":"Meet the team | Patrick Coghlan | Chief Executive Officer"},{"role":"cfo","name":"David Kirton","title":"Chief Financial Officer","source_url":"https://creditorwatch.com.au/company/about-us","source_kind":"company","evidence":"David Kirton | Chief Financial Officer"},{"role":"other","name":"Joseph Vartuli","title":"Chief Technology Officer","source_url":"https://creditorwatch.com.au/company/about-us","source_kind":"company","evidence":"Joseph Vartuli | Chief Technology Officer"},{"role":"other","name":"Matthew Jackson","title":"Chief Commercial Officer","source_url":"https://creditorwatch.com.au/company/about-us","source_kind":"company","evidence":"Matthew Jackson | Chief Commercial Officer"},{"role":"other","name":"Stephen Wood","title":"Chairman","source_url":"https://warburgpincus.com/2026/07/09/warburg-pincus-signs-agreement-to-invest-in-creditorwatch-australias-leading-commercial-credit-agency/","source_kind":"sponsor","evidence":"said Stephen Wood, Chairman, CreditorWatch"}],"notes":"Legal entity Commercial Credit Holdings Limited (ACN 654 459 971), MLC Centre, Level 49, 25 Martin Place, Sydney. More than 10,000 customers. Email is the company secretary address printed on its shareholder notices. No revenue or EBITDA disclosed.","sources":{"description":{"url":"https://warburgpincus.com/2026/07/09/warburg-pincus-signs-agreement-to-invest-in-creditorwatch-australias-leading-commercial-credit-agency/","name":"Warburg Pincus","kind":"sponsor","as_of":"2026-07-09","evidence":"CreditorWatch is Australia’s only dedicated B2B credit reporting agency. ... CreditorWatch offers a complete suite of credit reporting and risk management solutions across the entire customer lifecycle – from onboarding and automated credit decisioning through to ongoing monitoring, KYC/AML reporting and automated collections."},"employees":{"url":"https://warburgpincus.com/2026/07/09/warburg-pincus-signs-agreement-to-invest-in-creditorwatch-australias-leading-commercial-credit-agency/","name":"Warburg Pincus","kind":"sponsor","as_of":"2026-07-09","evidence":"Founded in 2010, CreditorWatch has grown to a team of 230+ people, servicing over 10,000 customers."},"founded_year":{"url":"https://creditorwatch.com.au/company/about-us","name":"CreditorWatch","kind":"company","as_of":null,"evidence":"CreditorWatch was founded in 2010 to empower Australian businesses to trade more confidently with their customers."},"country":{"url":"https://creditorwatch.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Project-Wharton-Results-of-Scheme-Meeting-CU-18.08.26400015371.2.pdf","name":"CreditorWatch (Commercial Credit Holdings Limited)","kind":"company","as_of":"2026-08-18","evidence":"Commercial Credit Holdings Limited ACN 654 459 971 MLC Centre, Level 49, 25 Martin Place Sydney NSW 2000"},"business_model":{"url":"https://warburgpincus.com/2026/07/09/warburg-pincus-signs-agreement-to-invest-in-creditorwatch-australias-leading-commercial-credit-agency/","name":"Warburg Pincus","kind":"sponsor","as_of":"2026-07-09","evidence":"CreditorWatch is Australia’s only dedicated B2B credit reporting agency."},"email":{"url":"https://creditorwatch.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Project-Wharton-Notice-of-Second-Court-Date-CU-17.08.26365302352.4.pdf","name":"CreditorWatch","kind":"company","as_of":"2026-08-18","evidence":"For further information, please contact: Company Secretary ... companysecretary@creditorwatch.com.au"}},"holding":{"sponsor":"Warburg Pincus","status_note":"Acquiring all shares via scheme of arrangement: shareholders approved 17 Aug 2026, implementation expected 3 Sep 2026 (completion not confirmed in sources read)","asset_class":"Private equity","deal_type":"Buyout","value_creation_plan":"Warburg Pincus will partner with the management team and continuing board members, bringing its global experience in scaling businesses and sector expertise to support CreditorWatch's next phase of growth and its mission to broaden access to data-driven credit insights for businesses of all sizes.","value_creation_source_url":"https://warburgpincus.com/2026/07/09/warburg-pincus-signs-agreement-to-invest-in-creditorwatch-australias-leading-commercial-credit-agency/","notes":"Agreement announced 2026-07-09. Bidder Currawong BidCo Pty Ltd, ultimately controlled by Warburg Pincus funds, to acquire all issued shares; prior majority shareholder Christian Beck. Second court hearing set for 2026-08-24. Terms not disclosed."}},{"name":"Accelerant","website":"https://accelerant.ai/","description":"Accelerant operates the Accelerant Risk Exchange, a data-driven platform that connects specialty insurance underwriters with risk capital providers through advanced analytics, real-time data and transparent underwriting insights.","sector":"Insurance / insurtech","subsector":"Specialty insurance risk exchange (MGA platform)","country":"Cayman Islands","founded_year":2018,"business_model":"B2B marketplace","email":"investors@accelerant.ai","email_type":"investor_relations","revenue":912900000,"revenue_currency":"USD","revenue_period":"FY2025 (12 months to 2025-12-31)","ebitda":281800000,"ebitda_currency":"USD","ebitda_period":"FY2025 (12 months to 2025-12-31)","ebitda_basis":"adjusted","leaders":[{"role":"ceo","name":"Jeff Radke","title":"Chairman and CEO (Co-Founder)","source_url":"https://www.thomabravo.com/press-releases/accelerant-enters-into-definitive-agreement-to-be-acquired-by-thoma-bravo","source_kind":"sponsor","evidence":"said Jeff Radke, Chairman and CEO of Accelerant."},{"role":"cfo","name":"Jay Green","title":"Chief Financial Officer (Principal Financial and Principal Accounting Officer)","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1997350/000199735026000003/arx-20251231.htm","source_kind":"filing","evidence":"/s/ Jay Green Chief Financial Officer (Principal Financial and Principal Accounting Officer) Jay Green"},{"role":"coo","name":"Matt Sternberg","title":"Chief Operating Officer, Risk Exchange","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1997350/000199735026000003/arx-20251231.htm","source_kind":"filing","evidence":"On December 7, 2025 , Matt Sternberg , Chief Operating Officer, Risk Exchange , entered into a Rule 10b5-1 trading arrangement"}],"notes":"Accelerant Holdings (NYSE: ARX), incorporated in the Cayman Islands with principal executive offices c/o Accelerant Re (Cayman) Ltd., Grand Cayman; the take-private release is datelined Atlanta, and the 10-K lists leased offices in Atlanta, New York City, Colorado Springs, Bermuda, Grand Cayman, Brussels, Dublin, London and Malta, with substantially all employees remote. IPO in 2025 (S-1 filed June 2025). FY2025 total revenues USD 912.9m; Adjusted EBITDA USD 281.8m (non-GAAP, 10-K reconciliation); GAAP net loss USD 1,345.2m driven by USD 1,379.7m profits-interest distribution expense. The 10-K gives no total employee count. Email is printed in the company's release.","sources":{"description":{"url":"https://www.thomabravo.com/press-releases/accelerant-enters-into-definitive-agreement-to-be-acquired-by-thoma-bravo","name":"Accelerant / Thoma Bravo joint release (thomabravo.com)","kind":"sponsor","as_of":"2026-08-13","evidence":"Accelerant operates the Accelerant Risk Exchange, a data-driven platform that connects specialty insurance underwriters with risk capital providers through advanced analytics, real-time data, and transparent underwriting insights."},"founded_year":{"url":"https://www.thomabravo.com/press-releases/accelerant-enters-into-definitive-agreement-to-be-acquired-by-thoma-bravo","name":"Accelerant / Thoma Bravo joint release (thomabravo.com)","kind":"sponsor","as_of":"2026-08-13","evidence":"“Accelerant has been building the preeminent specialty insurance marketplace since our founding in 2018,” said Jeff Radke"},"revenue":{"url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1997350/000199735026000003/arx-20251231.htm","name":"Accelerant Holdings Form 10-K FY2025 (SEC)","kind":"filing","as_of":"2026-03-18","evidence":"Total revenues $ 912.9 $ 602.6 $ 344.0 (years ended December 31, 2025, 2024, 2023; $ in millions)"},"ebitda":{"url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1997350/000199735026000003/arx-20251231.htm","name":"Accelerant Holdings Form 10-K FY2025 (SEC)","kind":"filing","as_of":"2026-03-18","evidence":"Adjusted EBITDA $ 281.8 $ 113.0 $ 36.1 Total revenues 912.9 602.6 344.0 Adjusted EBITDA margin 31 % 19 % 10 %"},"country":{"url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1997350/000199735026000003/arx-20251231.htm","name":"Accelerant Holdings Form 10-K FY2025 (SEC)","kind":"filing","as_of":"2026-03-18","evidence":"Cayman Islands ... Accelerant Holdings c/o Accelerant Re (Cayman) Ltd. Unit 106, Windward 3 , Regatta Office Park , West Bay Road , Grand Cayman , KY1-1108 ... (Address ... of Registrant’s Principal Executive Offices)"},"business_model":{"url":"https://www.thomabravo.com/press-releases/accelerant-enters-into-definitive-agreement-to-be-acquired-by-thoma-bravo","name":"Accelerant / Thoma Bravo joint release (thomabravo.com)","kind":"sponsor","as_of":"2026-08-13","evidence":"the data-driven risk exchange platform transforming the specialty insurance marketplace through the Accelerant Risk Exchange"},"email":{"url":"https://www.thomabravo.com/press-releases/accelerant-enters-into-definitive-agreement-to-be-acquired-by-thoma-bravo","name":"Accelerant / Thoma Bravo joint release (thomabravo.com)","kind":"sponsor","as_of":"2026-08-13","evidence":"For more information, visit investor.accelerant.ai or inquire via email at investors@accelerant.ai"}},"holding":{"sponsor":"Thoma Bravo","status_note":"Pending: definitive agreement (Aug 2026) to take Accelerant private at $20.25 per share; closing expected in H1 2027","asset_class":"Private equity","deal_type":"Take-private","value_creation_plan":"Thoma Bravo plans to partner with Jeff Radke and the team to invest behind the technology, data and capital capacity to support Accelerant's next phase of growth, bringing its technology and software expertise and financial and strategic resources.","value_creation_source_url":"https://www.thomabravo.com/press-releases/accelerant-enters-into-definitive-agreement-to-be-acquired-by-thoma-bravo","notes":"All-cash transaction with enterprise value of more than $4 billion; 49% premium to the 2026-08-12 close. Altamont Capital Partners (about 82% of voting rights) agreed to vote in favour and, with the founders, intends to retain equity alongside Thoma Bravo. Pending shareholder and insurance regulatory approvals as of the announcement."}},{"name":"Acumatica","website":"https://www.acumatica.com/","description":"Acumatica provides a cloud-native ERP platform that lets small and mid-sized organizations manage and automate processes from core financials to payroll and CRM in one system, with industry editions for manufacturing, distribution, construction, retail and professional services.","sector":"Software","subsector":"Cloud ERP for small and mid-market businesses","country":"United States","founded_year":2008,"business_model":"B2B SaaS sold through partner channel (VARs, OEM, ISVs)","email":"info@acumatica.com","email_type":"generic","employees":700,"employees_text":"700+ Employees","leaders":[{"role":"ceo","name":"John Case","title":"Chief Executive Officer","source_url":"https://www.acumatica.com/leadership-team/","source_kind":"company","evidence":"Executive Team | John Case | Chief Executive Officer"},{"role":"cfo","name":"Jordan Weitzen","title":"Chief Financial Officer","source_url":"https://www.acumatica.com/leadership-team/","source_kind":"company","evidence":"Jordan Weitzen | Chief Financial Officer | Executive Team"},{"role":"coo","name":"Sanket Akerkar","title":"President and COO","source_url":"https://www.acumatica.com/leadership-team/","source_kind":"company","evidence":"Sanket Akerkar | President and COO | Executive Team"}],"notes":"Global HQ at 3075 112th Avenue NE, Suite 200, Bellevue, WA. Over 10,000 customers; 100% channel-driven (350+ VARs, OEM private label, xRP platform for vertical ISVs). Employees '700+' from the About page, which carries no date. Under EQT (2019-2025) headcount grew more than 3x and revenue 7x per EQT; no revenue or EBITDA figure disclosed.","sources":{"description":{"url":"https://www.vistaequitypartners.com/news/acumatica-to-be-acquired-by-vista-equity-partners/","name":"Acumatica release via Business Wire (Vista site)","kind":"wire","as_of":"2025-05-29","evidence":"Acumatica’s cloud-native Enterprise Resource Planning (“ERP”) platform enables a range of mid-market organizations to digitally manage and automate mission-critical processes from core financial management to payroll and Customer Relationship Management (“CRM”) in a single, unified system."},"founded_year":{"url":"https://www.acumatica.com/about-us/","name":"Acumatica","kind":"company","as_of":null,"evidence":"Our global team | 2008 | Year Founded | 7 | Offices | 700+ | Employees | 10,000+ | Customers"},"employees":{"url":"https://www.acumatica.com/about-us/","name":"Acumatica","kind":"company","as_of":null,"evidence":"2008 Year Founded | 7 Offices | 700+ Employees | 10,000+ Customers"},"country":{"url":"https://www.acumatica.com/contact-us/","name":"Acumatica","kind":"company","as_of":null,"evidence":"Acumatica Global HQ | Seattle, WA | 3075 112th Avenue NE, Suite 200 | Bellevue, WA 98004, USA"},"business_model":{"url":"https://www.acumatica.com/about-us/","name":"Acumatica","kind":"company","as_of":null,"evidence":"We’re 100% channel-driven | 3 go-to-market models | Acumatica Branded Resellers | Private Label (OEM) | xRP Cloud Platform For Vertical ISVs"},"email":{"url":"https://www.acumatica.com/contact-us/","name":"Acumatica","kind":"company","as_of":null,"evidence":"Bellevue, WA 98004, USA | info@acumatica.com | +1-888-228-8300"}},"holding":{"sponsor":"Vista Equity Partners","status":"current","status_note":"Acquired from EQT in 2025 (Flagship strategy)","asset_class":"Private equity","deal_type":"Secondary buyout","value_creation_plan":"Vista said it is excited to partner with Acumatica and its community of partners to drive continued growth and product innovation and deliver greater value to customers, with its investment intended to help power Acumatica's AI-first product strategy.","value_creation_source_url":"https://www.vistaequitypartners.com/news/acumatica-to-be-acquired-by-vista-equity-partners/","notes":"Definitive agreement announced 2025-05-29; Vista lists Year of Investment 2025, Status Current, Strategy Flagship. Terms not disclosed."}},{"name":"Acumatica","website":"https://www.acumatica.com/","description":"Acumatica provides a cloud-native ERP platform that lets small and mid-sized organizations manage and automate processes from core financials to payroll and CRM in one system, with industry editions for manufacturing, distribution, construction, retail and professional services.","sector":"Software","subsector":"Cloud ERP for small and mid-market businesses","country":"United States","founded_year":2008,"business_model":"B2B SaaS sold through partner channel (VARs, OEM, ISVs)","email":"info@acumatica.com","email_type":"generic","employees":700,"employees_text":"700+ Employees","leaders":[{"role":"ceo","name":"John Case","title":"Chief Executive Officer","source_url":"https://www.acumatica.com/leadership-team/","source_kind":"company","evidence":"Executive Team | John Case | Chief Executive Officer"},{"role":"cfo","name":"Jordan Weitzen","title":"Chief Financial Officer","source_url":"https://www.acumatica.com/leadership-team/","source_kind":"company","evidence":"Jordan Weitzen | Chief Financial Officer | Executive Team"},{"role":"coo","name":"Sanket Akerkar","title":"President and COO","source_url":"https://www.acumatica.com/leadership-team/","source_kind":"company","evidence":"Sanket Akerkar | President and COO | Executive Team"}],"notes":"Global HQ at 3075 112th Avenue NE, Suite 200, Bellevue, WA. Over 10,000 customers; 100% channel-driven (350+ VARs, OEM private label, xRP platform for vertica